. In a double cleanse, the skin is first washed with an oil-based product (such as a cleansing balm or oil) and then followed by a water-based product (such as a gel, cream or milk cleanser).<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","media_type":"image"}},"question_xzWNxX":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Moisturizing the skin","text":"<p>The skin needs both hydration (water) and moisture (oil). All skin types benefit from hydration, but some may be especially dehydrated and require more water-based care.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","media_type":"image"}},"question_rzcVBd":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Exfoliating the skin","text":"<p>The skin naturally sheds dead cells, but sometimes it needs a little help. Dead skin buildup can make the complexion look dull and clog pores, which may lead to breakouts and blackheads.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","media_type":"image"}}},"block_order":["section_header_K4cqYy","image_neDfWP","question_cekpBB","question_nNMeDA","question_XqjRqV","question_xzWNxX","question_rzcVBd"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.faq.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","title_style":"subheading","enable_full_width":false,"media_position":"media_first","md_padding_top":56,"md_padding_bottom":40,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":24}},"collection_list_QPGfrJ":{"type":"collection-list","blocks":{"section_header_33Ktq3":{"type":"section_header","settings":{"subtitle":"BRIDAL","subtitle_tag":"h6","title":"YOUR RING, YOUR STORY","title_tag":"h2","text":"<p><br\/>Whether you love a classic solitaire, want to build your own, or dream of something no one else has, <strong>Embark Bridal<\/strong> is here for every step. Our specialists guide you from first look to forever.<br\/><\/p>","text_alignment":"text-align-center","sm_size_multiplier":"sm-size--default","size_multiplier":"size--default"}},"collection_9WqKPM":{"type":"collection","disabled":true,"settings":{"collection":"","card_bg":"bg-solid","custom_title":""}}},"block_order":["section_header_33Ktq3","collec